            <h2 id="features-heading" class="mt-4 text-[2rem] font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[2.15rem] dark:text-white">Everything you need to <span class="text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">follow up</span></h2>

            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600 sm:text-[15px] dark:text-gray-300">Six tools that work together, from the first contact to the last payment.</p>
        </div>

